  "observations": [
    "Actual clients use distinct native session IDs and list six canonical tools; calculator report and accepted processed Markdown equal HTTP.",
    "Interleaved HTTP/modern/older calls exhaust one local allowance despite a forged private key header. Mismatched modern routing/version headers reject, wrong origins and malformed IDs refuse, and GET/DELETE are 405.",
    "Thirty further official handshakes fill 32 attempts; the next request is 429 with Retry-After. Existing clients remain usable. Native existing-ID initialise refuses 400, preserves IDs and cannot reopen allocation.",
    "Native SQL observes only __miniflare_do_name and _cf_METADATA tables after actual calls and 32 conversations; actual eviction makes old IDs 404, and a new official handshake works.",
    "Eight actual older calculations fill the per-instance pool. A different conversation cannot cancel the first request; its owner cancels and releases a place within one second, a replacement enters immediately and remaining work closes.",
    "A real outgoing modern TCP AbortSignal fires and stops that caller. There is no prompt backend place release; a replacement receives safe capacity refusal. Eight actual operations release at the five-second budget.",
    "Thirty-two actual metadata operations fill native request capacity. A further POST is immediately 503. No new HTTP request or manual callback is made while the actual native alarm releases all 32 operations within three seconds. Old IDs then fail; a fresh official handshake lists tools.",
    "Memory-only compilation of the actual API declaration supplies SDK-generated export inventory; provider, credential and network operations refuse. Real generated class export plus clients prevent emulator-only binding false proof.",
    "Native graph create/no-change/update cases contain the genuine object class on the API and omit it on the Website; no provider write occurs.",
    "All 616 actual policy cases pass after correcting an initially nonexistent neighbouring fixture target. Exact host decoder admission grants no encoder/runtime/neighbouring-service permission."
